# RX-02 explicit launch context — completed experimental increment
PR: https://github.com/applicate2628/mcp-local-hub/pull/625
Commit:
bfff5699d893199f4c18d15add2a39e801e94a78
Base: 7257b97b19f06ab50402c620ec75b13fc53b1836

Implementation: complete explicit child environment and absolute cwd through existing NativeOwner creation core, optional BorrowedStdio unchanged. No parent environment/cwd mutation. Legacy APIs retain inheritance.
Contract: caller-sorted unique Windows ordinal names; full block including explicit empty; bounded UTF-16; no hidden fallback/parent merge; validation before native owner acquisition.

Verification: native Windows x86_64, Rust 1.99.1. Full experimental crate:34 native integration tests +3 unit tests +2 compile-fail docs, 3debug runs and1release run, all passed. Clippy -Dwarnings, fmt and diff-check passed.
Negative controls: compiled ignore-context stub failed8 cases; null environment exposed fake parent sentinel; null cwd exposed parent cwd. Both mutations restored and full tests rerun.
One test-only Clippy constant-chunk warning fixed through std as_chunks, not suppressed.
Cargo.lock/dependency versions unchanged; Globalization feature enabled in existing cached windows-sys. No installation or network dependency fetching.

Limits: Windows-only APIs; no Unix runtime/cross-build this iteration; caller env overlay/SDK-required keys/hidden drive entries not implemented. Cwd is pathname, not anchored security identity. OS/runtime may synthesize environment entries; plaintext erasure not claimed. No FFI, product integration, speedup claim or independent review.
Source/evidence/cache/temp are inside D:\dev\ChatGPT. Only confirmed unnecessary RED-owned relative marker moved to trash; unique evidence and active workspace retained.
Readback: remote branch equals exact checked local head; worktree clean; all eight published source blobs match tested manifest.
Next gates: native acquisition/resume/cleanup fault cases and calling-side/FFI contracts; maintain independent work on other planned candidates without changing working Hub.
===== END RESULTS.md =====

